*
*  Definition:
*  ===========
*
*       DOUBLE PRECISION FUNCTION DLANHS( NORM, N, A, LDA, WORK )
*
*       .. Scalar Arguments ..
*       CHARACTER          NORM
*       INTEGER            LDA, N
*       ..
*       .. Array Arguments ..
*       DOUBLE PRECISION   A( LDA, * ), WORK( * )
